[ar:Danni Carra/SABAI]
[ti:Mirror]
[al:Mirror]
[by:netease]
[00:00.20]This feels a little too perfect how we are now
[00:00.20]我们此刻的感受有点太完美了
[00:06.39]You think I throw a little caution but I don't want this to change
[00:06.39]你认为我有点不谨慎 但我不希望这一点改变
[00:13.13]Been waiting too long for a moment like this
[00:13.13]等待这样的时刻等得太久了
[00:17.66]Said that you won't leave
[00:17.66]你说你不会离开
[00:19.23]Better off with me
[00:19.23]和我在一起很好
[00:21.37]The kind of feeling I can't explain
[00:21.37]我解释不了这种感觉
[00:26.31]Like how it feels stretched in the moonlight
[00:26.31]仿佛身在月光下如释重负的感觉
[00:29.32]Like how it feels under the stars
[00:29.32]仿佛身置身在星空下的感觉
[00:32.44]A step out of bounds with our own plight
[00:32.44]走出我们自己的困境
[00:35.43]A push towards the peace in my heart
[00:35.43]将平静送进我的心中
[00:37.86]If it rains down all on us
[00:37.86]如果雨落在我们身上
[00:43.95]Drown out the noise
[00:43.95]盖过一切声音
[00:46.98]And I'll trust the
[00:46.98]我会相信
[00:49.20]Mirror, mirror on the wall
[00:49.20]墙上的魔镜
[00:52.19]Is it better to watch me fall
[00:52.19]难道看着我沦陷公平吗
[00:55.05]Broken up in pieces
[00:55.05]心已经碎了一地
[00:57.92]Can you see me bleeding
[00:57.92]你能否看到我在滴血
[01:01.25]Mirror, mirror tell me please
[01:01.25]魔镜 魔镜请告诉我
[01:04.30]If these broken memories
[01:04.30]如果这些支离破碎的记忆
[01:07.00]Are enough to break free
[01:07.00]足以挣脱出脑海之中
[01:10.19]Will it fix us slowly
[01:10.19]这样是否会将我们慢慢治愈
[01:40.69]I'm moving along with what fits best for
[01:40.69]我与最合适的人选一路相随
[01:46.10]Taking me forward and back at all I know
[01:46.10]带着我共进退 而且我知道
[01:50.60]Still leads right through
[01:50.60]依旧一直走向
[01:53.40]To the start of end where the past can't chase us
[01:53.40]那尽头处的起点 那边过去无法将我们追赶
[01:57.97]You should stay for while
[01:57.97]你应该多停留一会儿
[01:59.44]Disregard all the miles
[01:59.44]无视所谓的遥不可及
[02:01.80]If It's you and I will be okay
